ss water that binds earth to heaven, lies a glimmer of hope - and perhaps a deeper truth.\u201d</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot;, itself a homage to an older game made by Jazzuo. I aimed to capture the magic of GOI's intensely difficult gameplay, which becomes comically easy once you master it.</p>","developers":["Pontypants"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/c90246d61d91e12b89791162afcd9ab34297fd09/header.jpg?t=1756748048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 970/Radeon RX470 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2497920/1378498942/d0ddfb584086a9e2dca57f8d3b048be516d1e563/1756142894/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756144663","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2497920/1378498942/d0ddfb584086a9e2dca57f8d3b048be516d1e563/1756142894/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756144663","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com